{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……真难缠」", "text_idx": 152, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2578", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我猜他也会这么做，瓜生他不可能这么轻易就接受的」", "text_idx": 155, "plain": "「……我猜他也会这么做，瓜生他不可能这么轻易就接受的」", "plain_idx": 155, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5377", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我明白，但是我连告白的机会都没有」", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2579", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只要一找他说话他“咻”的一下就溜走了，简直就像条鳗鱼一样」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": "「只要一找他说话他“咻”的一下就溜走了，简直就像条鳗鱼一样」", "plain_idx": 160, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2580", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「把自己喜欢的人比作鳗鱼……」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5378", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「他当哥哥的时候还好说，但是想和他交往的话他那防御便是铜墙铁壁」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": "「他当哥哥的时候还好说，但是想和他交往的话他那防御便是铜墙铁壁」", "plain_idx": 164, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2581", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是你也不打算放弃对吧？」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5379", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2582", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们想想下一步该怎么走吧」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5380", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早上去叫他起床然后突然告白」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2583", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样是能抓住他，但是他真的会认真听你说吗？」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": "「这样是能抓住他，但是他真的会认真听你说吗？」", "plain_idx": 174, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5381", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那晚上偷偷钻进他的被窝里」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2584", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「告白前……樱乃的话确实做得到呢。\\n　但是这样做有什么意义吗？」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": "「告白前……樱乃的话确实做得到呢。　但是这样做有什么意义吗？」", "plain_idx": 179, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5382", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「用手机告白呢」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2585", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感觉会和平时聊天的结果差不多」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5383", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「用邮件呢」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2586", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是他说没看到呢？他说没收到邮件呢？那你怎么办？」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5384", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊呜……还有什么其他的好办法吗」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2587", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃你已经钻进死胡同里了」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5385", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那要是你来，你会怎么做？」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2588", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5386", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「会怎么做？」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2589", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想想……在黄昏时分的屋顶上告白吧」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5387", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「结女的屋顶是上不去的吧？」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2590", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那黄昏的海边呢」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5388", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这里离海边好远好远的？」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2591", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「黄昏的——」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": "「黄昏的——」", "plain_idx": 207, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5389", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你很喜欢黄昏吗？」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2592", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我也钻进死胡同里了」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5390", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是你不觉得告白就给人一种该在黄昏时分的感觉吗？」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5391", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，有」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2593", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过嘛，事实上也不一定非得在黄昏时表白」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5392", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一起出去玩或者回家路上怎么样呢？」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2594", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然要搁电视剧里肯定不会这么演，\\n　但现实里的应该大多都是这种时候表白的吧」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": "「虽然要搁电视剧里肯定不会这么演，　但现实里的应该大多都是这种时候表白的吧」", "plain_idx": 222, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5393", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对我而言，就是一起吃饭的时候或者在哥哥的房间玩的时候是最合适的」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": "「对我而言，就是一起吃饭的时候或者在哥哥的房间玩的时候是最合适的」", "plain_idx": 224, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2595", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5394", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2596", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么说呢，还真是一点浪漫和情调都没有啊」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5395", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，是啊」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2597", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但瓜生他，说不还真会挑这种时候，冷不丁的来上一句」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5396", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有可能」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2598", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是你被告白了，你打算怎么做？」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5397", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「被哥哥表白？我想……应该不大可能」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2599", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这样话题不就接不下去了吗，我是说假如啦」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": "「你这样话题不就接不下去了吗，我是说假如啦」", "plain_idx": 241, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5398", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2600", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是真的会被告白的话，那我一定会被吓一跳吧」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": "「要是真的会被告白的话，那我一定会被吓一跳吧」", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2601", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你要是这都不被吓到，就该我被你吓到了」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5399", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也没有被告白过，不是很清楚。\\n　说不定会因为过于吃惊而给拒绝掉呢」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": "「我也没有被告白过，不是很清楚。　说不定会因为过于吃惊而给拒绝掉呢」", "plain_idx": 250, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2602", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2603", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "门口有双鞋子。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
