{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与其做一些奇怪的事情，不如想到什么说什么。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": "与其做一些奇怪的事情，不如想到什么说什么。", "plain_idx": 260, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯，就这么办吧」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2606", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是失败了可能连晚饭都吃不好了，\\n还是等饭后再——", "text_idx": 263, "plain": "要是失败了可能连晚饭都吃不好了，还是等饭后再——", "plain_idx": 264, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "来电话了。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你好，这里是瓜生家」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2607", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『哟。是我的宝贝女儿接的，真是幸运』", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0000", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爸爸」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2608", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『抱歉呀，一直以来辛苦你了』", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0001", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没关系，有哥哥在」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2609", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『说起来新吾最近如何？\\n　我们也有些日子没见了』", "text_idx": 277, "plain": "『说起来新吾最近如何？　我们也有些日子没见了』", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0002", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爸爸，好冷淡」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2610", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『对自己儿子不狠点儿怎么行』", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0003", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『父亲和儿子就是这种关系，儿子可是迟早要打倒父亲的人』", "text_idx": 284, "plain": "『父亲和儿子就是这种关系，儿子可是迟早要打倒父亲的人』", "plain_idx": 284, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0004", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爸爸和哥哥没有血缘关系。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是爸爸一直把哥哥当作亲生儿子对待。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": "但是爸爸一直把哥哥当作亲生儿子对待。", "plain_idx": 287, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "哥哥也明白这件事，一直以对亲生父亲的态度和爸爸相处。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": "哥哥也明白这件事，一直以对亲生父亲的态度和爸爸相处。", "plain_idx": 288, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和妈妈也是一样。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明成为家人这么简单。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『嗯。怎么了？我开玩笑的。\\n　我和新吾不会打起来的你放心啦』", "text_idx": 291, "plain": "『嗯。怎么了？我开玩笑的。　我和新吾不会打起来的你放心啦』", "plain_idx": 292, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0005", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我觉得哥哥他一定会选择和平解决的」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2611", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……确实』", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0006", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爸爸开心地笑了起来。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且就算是打起来了\\n　我也会站在哥哥这一方的」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": "「而且就算是打起来了　我也会站在哥哥这一方的」", "plain_idx": 300, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2612", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『当父亲的就属这种时候最难受啊……』", "text_idx": 302, "plain": "『当父亲的就属这种时候最难受啊……』", "plain_idx": 302, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0007", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『看起来你们相处得还不错呀』", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0008", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，是关系不错的好兄妹」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2613", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『那我就放心了』", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0009", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『可别背着我们偷偷干坏事哦，\\n　那我可是要把你们扫地出门的』", "text_idx": 310, "plain": "『可别背着我们偷偷干坏事哦，　那我可是要把你们扫地出门的』", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0010", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2614", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『怎么，被我说中了？』", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0011", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「非常遗憾，并没有」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2615", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『遗憾什么啊……\\n　你兄控我没意见，但是偶尔也要想一想你老爸我啊』", "text_idx": 318, "plain": "『遗憾什么啊……　你兄控我没意见，但是偶尔也要想一想你老爸我啊』", "plain_idx": 319, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0012", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事的，我一直都在远处的天空下为你祈祷」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": "「没事的，我一直都在远处的天空下为你祈祷」", "plain_idx": 321, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2616", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『为什么要在远处。\\n　不过嘛，一直外出不归的我也没资格说这话呢』", "text_idx": 323, "plain": "『为什么要在远处。　不过嘛，一直外出不归的我也没资格说这话呢』", "plain_idx": 324, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0013", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『过段时间我手里的工作也要告一段落了，到时候我就和你妈约一下时间，一起回来』", "text_idx": 326, "plain": "『过段时间我手里的工作也要告一段落了，到时候我就和你妈约一下时间，一起回来』", "plain_idx": 326, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0014", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。我就不抱期待地期待着了」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2617", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『不愧是我这么多年的女儿真了解我啊，我后面还会打过来的』", "text_idx": 330, "plain": "『不愧是我这么多年的女儿真了解我啊，我后面还会打过来的』", "plain_idx": 330, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0015", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要勉强自己」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2618", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『啊，要是发生了什么就给我……\\n　啊对，有新吾在也用不着我出手』", "text_idx": 334, "plain": "『啊，要是发生了什么就给我……　啊对，有新吾在也用不着我出手』", "plain_idx": 335, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0016", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "父亲", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『要是有什么烦恼随时给我打电话』", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "fa0017", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我会的」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2619", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2620", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "背着父母吗……", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是啊。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算我和哥哥真的两情相悦，又该怎么给父母说呢。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": "就算我和哥哥真的两情相悦，又该怎么给父母说呢。", "plain_idx": 344, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我觉得他们应该不会反对。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是那也只是觉得，实际情况谁也不知道。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2621", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我切实地理解体会到了\\n爱理说的“和普通的恋爱不同”到底意味着什么。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": "我切实地理解体会到了爱理说的“和普通的恋爱不同”到底意味着什么。", "plain_idx": 349, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和哥哥交往这件事，\\n并不仅仅是属于我们两个人的问题。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": "和哥哥交往这件事，并不仅仅是属于我们两个人的问题。", "plain_idx": 351, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
